OVERVIEW: Recover the video bitstream from a DICOM Video object

USAGE: dicom-video extract <input> --output <output> [--force] [--verbose]

ARGUMENTS:
  <input>                 Input DICOM file

OPTIONS:
  -o, --output <output>   Output video file path
  --force                 Overwrite the output file if it exists
  -v, --verbose           Show the reasoning behind each step
  --version               Show the version.
  -h, --help              Show help information.

